# EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant — Project Development

 ## 1\. Development Overview

 **EduGenie** is developed as an AI-powered educational web application that integrates **Google Gemini** with a student-friendly learning interface. The development focuses on creating an interactive assistant capable of answering questions, explaining concepts, generating quizzes, summarizing study materials, and tracking learning activities.

 The development process is divided into frontend, backend, database, AI integration, and testing components.

